      "writtenOn": "2017-06-19T06:35:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure how this will work, because we don\u0027t have one single \"callback type\", but instead HIDL generates a new, unique callback type per method (why!?!).  So we have setLocalPrefixesCallback and setUpstreamParametersCallback and so on.",
