      "writtenOn": "2017-06-19T01:31:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You might be able to mostly automate the creation of these offload controller wrappers with something like this:\n\n\npublic boolean controllerWrapper(Consumer\u003cCallback\u003e fn, String errMsg) {\n  final CbResults results \u003d new CbResults();\n  try {\n    fn.accept(results.callback());\n  } catch (RemoteException e) {\n    mLog.e(errMsg + e);\n    return false;\n  }\n\n  if (!results.success) mLog.e(errMsg + results.errMsg);\n  return results.success;\n}\n\n\n\npublic boolean addDownstreamPrefix(String ifname, String prefix) {\n  controllerWrapper((callback) -\u003e  mOffloadControl.addDownstream(ifname, prefix, callback), \"failed to addDownstream\");\n}\n\n\nAlthough this starts to look pretty obscure and less readable. Not necessarily a good thing to do.",
      "range": {
